{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhanggu-e-o012","title":"武昌酣饮昭出车中坐权惭罢酒","accounts":[{"id":"zhanggu-a-d50f45aa7f33613d77d8","label":"正文","text":"武昌酣饮昭出车中坐权惭罢酒","evidence":["zhanggu-q-dc2fe06d8aa37aab42ae"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"临钓台饮酒大醉、使人以水洒群臣曰今日酣饮惟醉堕台中乃当止耳、遣人呼昭还谓曰为共作乐耳公何为怒乎、默然有惭色遂罢酒","evidence":["zhanggu-q-dc2fe06d8aa37aab42ae"]},{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"正色不言出外车中坐、对曰昔纣为糟丘酒池长夜之饮当时亦以为乐不以为恶也","evidence":["zhanggu-q-dc2fe06d8aa37aab42ae"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["zhanggu-q-dc2fe06d8aa37aab42ae"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhanggu-q-dc2fe06d8aa37aab42ae","source_order":[52,26,0],"order":9249}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0133","name":"张昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhanggu-q-dc2fe06d8aa37aab42ae","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-f48a21797822f1edd6ed","layer":"original","quote":"权于武昌，临钓台〖11〗，饮酒大醉。权使人以水洒群臣，曰：“今日酣饮，惟醉堕台中，乃当止耳！”昭正色不言，出外，车中坐。权遣人呼昭还，谓曰：“为共作乐耳，公何为怒乎？”昭对曰：“昔纣为糟丘酒池长夜之饮〖12〗，当时亦以为乐，不以为恶也！”权默然，有惭色，遂罢酒","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
